<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's al-Ahli Bank says net up 45.9pct.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's al-Ahli Bank says net up 45.9pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (Million dinars unless stateted)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net profit			6.334	  4.342</p>
<p> Net interest income	  77.884	 73.310</p>
<p> Provisions			6.180	  5.595</p>
<p> Total dividend		  0.000	  0.000</p>
<p>Full name: Al-Ahli Bank of Kuwait KSC</p>
<p>Note: The bank's general assembly authorised the board of directors to issue bonds with a maximum total value of 50.0 million dinars.</p>
<p>Kuwait newsroom, Inal Ersan +965-243-1920</p>
